UPSTREAM 1 — Atoll (Dynamic Island for macOS base)
================================================================================

Source:    https://github.com/Ebullioscopic/Atoll
License:   GPL-3.0
Role:      Provides the macOS notch rendering surface, live activities
           framework, media controllers, system stats, lock-screen
           widgets, and the SwiftUI app shell that Isle is built on.

Atoll major contributors (see https://github.com/Ebullioscopic/Atoll/graphs/contributors):
  - Ebullioscopic (Hariharan Mudaliar) — maintainer
  - Atoll contributors community

Atoll is itself a derivative work of boring.notch
(https://github.com/TheBoredTeam/boring.notch), also GPL-3.0, by
TheBoredTeam. Original notch interaction model, media player
integration, AirDrop surface, file dock, and calendar event display
patterns originate there.

