UPSTREAM 2 — open-vibe-island (AI coding-agent integration backend)
================================================================================

Source:    https://github.com/Octane0411/open-vibe-island
License:   GPL-3.0
Role:      Provides the agent hook installer model, per-agent adapter
           pattern, and event-bus schema used by Isle's coding-agent
           live activities (Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, OpenCode,
           Gemini CLI, Kimi, Aider, Continue, Goose, Block Goose).

